[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11701.67, "timestamp": "03:15:01", "text": "以后应该多聚聚。地狱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11706.389, "timestamp": "03:15:06", "text": "是的。教我“不”。那游戏真是太棒了！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11708.79, "timestamp": "03:15:08", "text": "上帝。是的，乔。我将训练你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11711.67, "timestamp": "03:15:11", "text": "乔，去当速通玩家吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11712.79, "timestamp": "03:15:12", "text": "嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11715.67, "timestamp": "03:15:15", "text": "就是这样。我们将开始您的培训。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11717.99, "timestamp": "03:15:17", "text": "一日游。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11719.59, "timestamp": "03:15:19", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11724.07, "timestamp": "03:15:24", "text": "好的。乔，你保重。你好。感谢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11726.95, "timestamp": "03:15:26", "text": "今天就交给你了。祝你有个美好的夜晚"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11729.429, "timestamp": "03:15:29", "text": "各位先行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11733.19, "timestamp": "03:15:33", "text": "是的。再见。你好。再见。再见，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11740.229, "timestamp": "03:15:40", "text": "小心。小心。玩得开心。并且有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11742.15, "timestamp": "03:15:42", "text": "直播很精彩，晚安"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11748.79, "timestamp": "03:15:48", "text": "前方。你好。晚安。你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11750.79, "timestamp": "03:15:50", "text": "所以，所有那些曾是神话威尔士的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11754.71, "timestamp": "03:15:54", "text": "轮子，呃，我不得不退出合作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11757.99, "timestamp": "03:15:57", "text": "那是神话般的威尔士。"}]